aches. The requests of the carnival are many and strange, but if you are to survive this place you must solve the many riddles and charades revolving around the Forever Chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.poster.avif?t=1774638398\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.webm?t=1774638398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.mp4?t=1774638398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it desires to be shot, sometimes it desires to explode, sometimes it merely wants to watch. Whatever the chicken seeks you must determine <i>before the night is through</i>...</p>","developers":["ItsTheTalia","Autumn West"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/196bf619e0e5a83729167fb560a76db1585a70c3/header.jpg?t=1774638398","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958640/350729206/1924241c0488155b08de2cf40b397458e525f05e/1759956233/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761084742","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958640/350729206/1924241c0488155b08de2cf40b397458e525f05e/1759956233/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761084742","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958640/350729206/1924241c0488155b08de2cf40b397458e525f05e/1759956233/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761084742","id":257214484,"name":"Crawling Angels Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/